  "statement": "A wall of area $A = 1\\ \\text{m}^2$ is plaster, brick and insulation in series. The inside face is at $20\\ ^\\circ\\text{C}$ and the outside face at $-5\\ ^\\circ\\text{C}$. Find the heat loss $\\dot{Q}$.",
